{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_06",
  "title": "若退路在燃烧",
  "storyCode": "EP-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5944938ecf7a00b351e7658b69977b19e275c4677f62564166c42f77ba93a87d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "蒂奇？到底怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈维尔把审判庭的人引来了，胡安娜夫人被他们关在了船长室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你回来干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不知道......大概和你的目的一样吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等......对面甲板上躲着的......是你的朋友吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是伊西多吗？想不到他居然也回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿，我就说嘛，连我都放心不下，更何况他呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我朋友这么好的人，看到这边的火光，当然会回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么我也要来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃，来救火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醒醒，夫人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小珍珠......宝宝呢？你们不该回来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我把宝宝送回盐漠了，哪怕它身体孱弱，也不是完全没机会挣扎着活下去，至少好过被叛乱的船员宰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们不能留您一个人在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "您看起来状态不太好......\n难道他们对您做了什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没有......只是他们给我服了些药剂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们本来可以逃走，可以活下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我以为你这样执拗的人不会放弃得那么快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然我们都已经回来了，就别说这些了吧？女士，你是船队里最熟悉盐漠的人，你知道有什么逃跑的好去处吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们现在有几个人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "二十四个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很好，够我们夺下一艘船离开这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪一艘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "征服宣告号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那艘老船......它的速度可比不上新造的盐船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我最熟悉它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "况且，那艘船很旧，审判庭不会花费太多人力看守，我们夺船的难度不大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好，我带八个人去甲板，巡逻和放哨的我们会解决掉。剩下的人和极境先生从侧舷摸进船舱，搞定其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "胡安娜夫人很虚弱，走不快......这一路，我希望你看着她些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放心，我会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么动静？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我这把老骨头啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可信的船员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "蒂奇，甲板上的家伙全都打晕丢下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好，快上桅杆，听到我的指令就立刻升帆，我们需要以最快速度开动船只。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "搞定了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，底下的人也都搞定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "女士，辛苦您搭把手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "现在就等夫人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好好搜，执裁官阁下吩咐了，一定要找到那枚罗盘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尽责的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们已经翻遍了每间屋子，连相似的物件都没找到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再去找，或许有什么地方遗漏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尽责的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是，大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "二位，执裁官阁下命令有变，立刻组织一支小队和我追捕逃跑的炼金术师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么是你来送信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们现在依照协议在合作，为什么不可以是我来送信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尽责的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好吧，稍等片刻，我们去召集其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "辛苦二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈维尔为什么会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也不清楚，但无论如何，他都帮我们引开了那些习武教士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等他们离开，我们可以躲在那排帐篷后面继续走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不论从哪艘盐船上都看不到那里，他们不会发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看得出，你的出逃经验真的非常丰富。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再坚持下，很快就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你先去甲板，我还要去工坊取些东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快去快回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是......旧时代的船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们对罗盘的渴求，难道指向灾祸的源头，那片海洋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我放在哪儿了来着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是你一直在组织围剿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是你一直在修复罗盘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "总有人劝我，说我该把人想得更善良些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "事实总会证明他们的愚昧。最初见到你，我就知道你想将罗盘据为己有，为了你那罪恶的炼金研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我果然没有看错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "罗盘已经毁了。我到现在都还没能把它的残骸从塑金台上抠下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那摊黑泥？不。那不是真正的罗盘，你的谎言毫无意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "审判庭丢失的每一件东西，都值得你们如此大费周章，大开杀戒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你知道罗盘能腐化人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只当它是航海道具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵。航海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "意图反对世俗审判、逃避道德约束的人，总会去走那些人迹罕至的荆棘道路，驶向那些无人登陆的异域彼岸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "仿佛觉得不朽的事业，能成为他们一切罪名的庇护所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看不出我有犯什么罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "包庇偷窃犯，盗食镇民遗体，袭击审判庭教士，与为害城镇的强盗为伍......这还不够？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欲加之罪而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵......你开始否认自己的罪行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "每一个犯下罪孽的人都会如此急切地否认，我也不例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我最终承认了我的罪，我找到了赎罪的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的生命从最初就系于食人的罪行，我的存在从最初就是罪孽的存在，我不配简简单单地死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你，你在被欲望沾染之前，曾是正直良善之人，你还有资格死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我会帮你解脱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是疯子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我没时间和你纠缠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "奇怪，伊西多怎么还没来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没关系，反正他在这条船上，我们人就算是已经齐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大家都准备好了，只等你一声令下，夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "升帆吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们该启航了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这艘船......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（该死......胡安娜不知道这个疯子在这里。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（等船只动起来，他只会带来更多麻烦。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "妄图逃走的人，都在这里了，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们与这艘旧时代遗留下来的孽物，都会终止于此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "执裁官的攻势愈发猛烈，伊西多只能勉力抵挡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（这样根本没有用......总得做点什么......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这是他的炼金工坊，总有他能在这里做到的事情吧？\n在这里他最擅长什么呢？\n从在这里生活的经历来看，他做过最多的，无非是制造各种各样的爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爆炸......\n是该有场爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳咳......呸！呸——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......棘刺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你终于来了，我在甲板上都快吓死了，你说要去炼金工坊拿东西，结果等半天你都没来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在炼金工坊遇到了审判庭的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "底下的人我们都清理干净了啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也不清楚，那家伙半路摸进来要找罗盘，一言不合就直接开始动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为了甩脱他我只能引爆了炼金工坊，把他炸了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你这家伙简直要把小半艘船都炸掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......干得好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过，里面的东西还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "或许还能抢救出来一些......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们要去骸礁峡谷，穿过那里，就能进入海洋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在那之前，你说不定还能再尝试一次修复罗盘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "西尔弗阁下！执、执裁官阁下还在那艘船上！我们得去救他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那样剧烈的爆炸，没人可以幸存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是，执裁官阁下他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我说了，不要去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "执裁官阁下壮烈牺牲，难道我们却要浪费他为我们创造的生机，一厢情愿地牺牲活人去拯救逝者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "万一他还......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "此时此刻，雅隆才更需要你们。现在，去整理缴获的物资，安置投降的海盗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "稳点！桅杆要断了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是准备把船撞碎在骸骨上，让我们挂在上面晒成咸人干吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "左满舵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——左满舵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "右舷受损了！如果再被蒸汽冲击，船体会彻底散架的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大型骨骸越来越密集了，掌握不好方向的话我们会先撞毁的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里已经开始有蒸汽喷发了，说明我们正在接近骸礁峡谷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要躲进骸礁峡谷，那帮混球就不敢追进来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我们自己怎么办？那里遍地乱喷的高压蒸汽随便就能给船开个洞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "总比被审判庭抓住好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滚烫的蒸汽从骸骨的孔隙中喷出，惊人的力道撕开风帆。\n几人在剧烈的冲击下腾空而起，又重重摔回甲板。\n疯狂旋转的舵轮早已无法被握住，在蒸汽的冲击下，船体不受控制地向着一根十几米高的庞大骸骨滑去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "胡安娜没有言语，像是在等待什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......温蒂！你是工程部的，有什么法子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也是第一次见黄金时代的老船，更何况它还被改造成了这副模样......我没法立刻搞清它的运行原理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我们要弃船吗？现在跳下去说不定我们还能有命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你疯了！没有船的话，半分钟之内你就会被盐鳞顶个对穿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——夫人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "完蛋了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "胡安娜看向了疯狂旋转的舵轮。\n百年间，这艘船被拆去了所有皮肉，只留下一副骨架。原本华丽的锦帆被拆解，取而代之的是鳞皮缝制的粗糙风帆。\n但它的舵轮依然矗立在甲板的正中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是把手搭上了一位舞伴的腰，胡安娜扶住舵轮，狂放地转动起来，墨色的长发像狂潮中翻卷的水草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "久违了，老朋友！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "征服宣告号急剧倾斜，与庞大骸骨擦肩而过。船上的几人拼命抓住绳索，才不至于被甩下船去。\n过去的几十年，这艘古旧的船总因为过于沉重而不得不沿着其他盐船留下的轨迹迟缓行动。\n但如今，它乘着风在庞大的骨骸间穿行，就像当年在胡安娜的掌控下，穿越险恶的礁石群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夫人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "船稳住了，船稳住了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......活下来了？我没死？我没被挂在哪根骸骨上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......你之前只说让我来救一下火......下次说清楚一点......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这也算是一种救火，对吧......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "棘刺！怎么样？！这里的东西还剩多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "站在满地狼藉之中，几人陷入了沉默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "塑金台算是勉强从工坊里抢救出来了，虽然外壳毁了，但能量输出还算稳定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "探针......只剩下这支老化严重的了，好在还能用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "之前从古董上拆出来的合金和源石也还有一点，不知道够不够用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有什么我能帮你的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你的手指和探针的针尖一样细的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一声悠长的咕噜声响起，极境有些尴尬地捂着自己的肚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "船上基本没剩什么食物了，照这样下去，我可能很快就会瘦到你需要的程度......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我们先找点东西吃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
